# Telegram push for contact-form submissions.
# 1. Message @BotFather -> /newbot -> copy the token.
# 2. Add the bot to a private channel/group (or DM it), send one message.
# 3. curl "https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates" and copy chat.id
#    (channel ids look like -1001234567890).
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
